pe":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吵什麼？怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"資深廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好了！聽說百珍宴的會場不知道怎麼回事，突然起了一陣妖火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"資深廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衛兵已經把會場全部圍起來了，不知道現在裡面什麼情況，也不知道陛下有沒有受傷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"資深廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說要……中斷百珍宴……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們收到消息，百珍宴混入了來歷不明的人，現在進行檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請所有人待在原地不要動，配合我們檢查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（該死……驚蟄那邊到底出什麼事了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，不能把她丟在那裡……得去看看……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的！不要走動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼辦怎麼辦，總不能在這裡打起來……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（來不及了……！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人！追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一營、五營，封鎖南門入口；七營、九營，關閉北門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人，由南向北仔細檢查。一旦查到身分可疑的人，直接逮捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情報說，破壞百珍宴的犯人至少為兩人一組共同作案，都小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要命，這麼多守軍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驚蟄啊驚蟄……你到底捅了多大的婁子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過聽起來倒還沒有被抓起來……你到底在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖……這宮殿怎麼這麼大啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼是你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是要去找陛下申請翻案嗎？怎麼會搞成這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道啊，那把火可不是我們放的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是偏偏在這個時候……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是趕快離開吧！要是被發現，就是有一百張嘴也說不清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要把麟青硯那個傢伙救出來呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……讓我去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼危險的事！怎麼能交給你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁城，我總比你熟悉一點，就算萬一被抓到了，也總有解釋的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我會找到麟少卿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是信不過我，是還在生我的氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就往南門跑，趕在衛兵封鎖出口之前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……跑出去以後，我們還在那家飯館碰頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要小心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，剛才有衛兵看到你的樣子了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……應該是被看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不好辦了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……對了！把你的衣服脫下來，換給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g6_baizhenbanquet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像看到前面有人跑過去了！那邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現場已經被清空了……麟少卿應該不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是到底會是誰在百珍宴上做這種事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望煌已經順利跑出去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼會是她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩個孩子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……難道真有命數？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎是不遠了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道她們那邊情況怎麼樣了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……找到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來就是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……好厲害的劍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這身打扮，看起來和一般士兵不太一樣啊。難道你是什麼將軍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休要多言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是麟青硯一直努力想要藏起來的人……可是她為什麼又要帶你來禁城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……我知道擅闖別人的國宴確實是件不禮貌的事，可你願不願意相信，我們真的沒有惡意……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是說，這是個誤會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有什麼誤會，禁軍追查你的下落，已經有四十年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是她的後人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？誰的後人？“她”是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當真不知——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，看起來，你沒有說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你被保護起來這麼久，莫非從來沒有人和你說過你的身世？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，還真讓你說對了……我也很好奇我的身世，到底有沒有人能告訴我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，禁軍？找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十年前，謀逆罪臣家中唯一一個下落不明的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……說什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，我再確認一遍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是1062年，在維多利亞出生的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，從我記事起，我就是在維多利亞長大的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你父親生前，似乎花了很多年在追查一個真相……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一……你發現，你周圍的一切，都是一個巨大的謊言……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是什麼和什麼！*炎國粗口*閉嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身分特殊，如何處置須聽候審決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃——！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的實力不弱，我沒有把握在不傷你的前提下將你拿住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想受傷的話，乖乖束手就擒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開什麼玩笑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉重的喘息）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是說過……出了事你先跑嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……麟青硯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯看到了煌的眼神。\n她明白，她卻只能沉默。\n她轉過身，擋在了煌的身前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿，我敬重你在大理寺的名望，之前才好意提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來你終究是一點都沒有把我的警告放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚自己在做什麼，不用你提醒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經察覺到了她的身分，卻還要庇護這個罪臣的後人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了真相……你們所有人都避而不談的真相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在說什麼……什麼叫……我是罪臣的後代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我爸他……到底是什麼人，他又是為什麼死的……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……本來打算今晚過後，就全部告訴你的。現在看起來實在不是個好時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要今天能活著離開這裡，之後你讓我怎麼道歉都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她今天必須跟我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……有我在，你休想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且不論贏過我，想要攔我，像你這樣的實力，得要三個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"驚雷在宮牆上炸開一個缺口，緊接著，又一道稍柔和的能量擊中了煌。\n她的身體飛出了這座禁城，向遙遠的地面墜去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌曾無數次從高處躍下，跳入戰場中央，或是任何需要她的地方。\n她從不曾畏懼，她相信自己的力量，相信她的許多同伴。\n她也絕不迷茫，她很清楚自己是誰，也很清楚自己堅守的方向和信仰。\n沒有什麼陰謀伎倆能抵擋她的熱量，就像晨霧無法遮蔽太陽。\n……可現在呢？\n等待她的不再是一個堅實的地面，而是無盡的深淵。\n她閉上了眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"寧茵氣若遊絲地躺在床上。\n老人拄著拐杖的手顫抖著，他幾欲摔倒。\n他已經活得夠久，見得夠多，他原本以為這世上已經不再有什麼能讓他失態的事。\n老人的嘴唇翕動著，但不論怎樣，他都沒能發出聲音。\n直到陰影中的人先開了口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她還活著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧大人留步，不可再上前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚你沒有見過我，她也沒有離開過家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她……這是怎麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她擅自闖入百珍宴，我發現她的時候，她正和那個孩子在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果今天她遇上的是其他任何一個人，她斷然活不下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十年了……竟然還是你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十年前，你把她留了下來，如今，又救她一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命……大抵是命吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……逃不過，到底逃不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我留下她並非為了救她，救下她的，是寧大人才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧大人曾立誓永遠不讓這樁舊案再被人知曉，才換來這個孩子的性命。如今看來，寧大人有食言之嫌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚變故，真龍總會知曉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"選擇在寧大人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一陣風起，彷彿什麼都沒有發生過。\n老人有些恍惚。\n可他聽到院牆外又傳來了一陣喧鬧。\n似是怒吼，似是哭訴，似是斥責。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是昏了頭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都秋天了……哪來的蟬鳴啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……我怎麼在這裡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，醒啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就說你體格好肯定沒事，看，這不還活蹦亂跳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姜還大驚小怪，非嚷嚷著要幫你找大夫，也不看看都幾點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我暈過去多久了……她們在哪裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯……寧茵她來過了嗎？我……怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急別急，你一口氣問這麼多，我也不知道從哪開始回答啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上的時候我本來想去晚市撿點便宜菜的，結果看見你就大咧咧地躺在路中央，我還以為你喝醉了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕你冷到感冒，就順手把你撿回來囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你睡得迷迷糊糊的，還罵人呢。罵這個偽君子，罵那個大騙子，還有好多……嘖嘖，都不知道你從哪裡學來這些炎國話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的寧茵，還有叫麟青硯什麼的……沒見過，不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去找她們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，你上哪去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……禁城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛可看見外面都是巡邏衛兵，你覺得自己還進得去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管，那我也得去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……把自己都弄丟了，你還想找誰啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒說錯啊，可不是把自己弄丟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道自己從哪來，想不通自己要上哪去，所以聽了別人三言兩語，連自己姓什麼叫什麼都搞不清，更不知道自己是誰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謬矣，謬矣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一粒橘子的種子，被風從江南吹到了江北，落地生根，開花結果。讓種子變成桔子的，不是江南也不是江北，是這幾十年的陽光雨露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是同樣一枚果子，江南江北的寫法雖不同，可果子還是這枚果子，不會有什麼變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"物有本末，事分名實……想通了這一點，才能再問別的一二三四啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……知道什麼？你是不是知道什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道什麼？我就是一個煮飯的廚師，知道的不過是油鹽醬醋、煎煮炒炸這些——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對，看見你我倒是想起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一直要找那種味道正宗的桔紅酥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像，知道怎麼做了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]}]}
